{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1541096-legacy-concept-the-fourth-axis","id":1541096,"title":"Legacy concept; The Fourth Axis","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2024-08-27T17:21:08-07:00","id":1541096,"title":"<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/icons/icon3.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" alt=\"\" /> Legacy concept; The Fourth Axis","content":"I wrote this legacy before I really understood the rules for making one, and having read a few other's work decided that each attainment was a combined spell, rather than two optional skills. Any suggestions for tweaking it for conformity with the rules while preserving the flavour? General suggestions welcome!<br /> <br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Legacy; The Fourth Axis</span></span></b><br /> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">It was Einstein who posited that the Lie respects that mass and energy are equivalent, but the 4th axis suggests that energy can distort space in the manner of its contemporary. Interested in dimensions above the mundane, Forces becomes the tool by which such exploration becomes possible.</span></span><br /> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b>Parent Path</b>: </span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Mastigos, Guardians of the Veil or Free council.</span></span><br /> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b>Nickname</b>:</span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Ascendants, Widdershins, The Departed.</span></span><br /> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b>Prerequisites</b>:</span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Forces 2 and Investigation 2 and either Academia 2, or Science 2.</span></span><br /> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b>Initiation</b>:</span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The desperate dash through death and spirit twilight had led to haggard and traumatic memories. Now, safe in his own oneiros, he painstakingly builds them into a helical staircase towering over the roilings of his mind. He can see the little pangs of hunger and tiredness below as his efforts drained his prone body wherever it lay. As the twisting stairs grew taller and closer together, he finally stood with a foot on each, and looked down at his own soul below. The potential energy juddered and the world flattened before him, the stair seemingly having no depth, the first step and the last appearing adjacent, yet separate. </span></span><br /> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b>Ruling</b>: </span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Forces</span></span><br /> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b>Yantras</b>: </span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Sacrifice of naturally occurring forces (+1 or +2), Corners where at least three edges meet (+1), Supernal doorways not originating from the caster (Irises, Avernian Gates, verges, etc) (+1 or +2 if it has strong symbology with the spell).</span></span><br /> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b>Oblations</b>:</span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Trying to see all sides of an issue, travelling for a long time, liberating a sentient from confinement, sleeping on a threshold or in a liminal space.</span></span><br /> <br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">First Attainment; Glimpse the Fourth Axis</span></span></b><br /> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Prerequisite: Initiation</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">As an instant action the mage may use a technique that allows a glimpse from a higher dimension, penetrating mere physical form. Mimicking night vision in the x-ray range.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Optional Arcanum: Space 1</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">With the addition of the Space arcana, this perception becomes 360 degrees adding the inward/outward eye effect. This includes the other side of walls and inside closed containers, and even inside living creatures.</span></span><br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Second Attainment; Light the Fourth Axis</span></span></b><br /> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Prerequisite: Forces 2, Investigation 3 and Science/Academia 3</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Light chases away the ignorance that keeps you moored to the third dimension. Control light as an instant action.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Optional Arcanum: Space 2</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">You understand that your form is just the shadow projected by your 4th dimensional self. You can juxtapose your form with your shadow, essentially break boundary within its area.</span></span><br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Third Attainment; Claim the Fourth Axis</span></span></b><br /> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Prerequisite: Forces 3, Investigation 4, 2 points in 3rd initiation skill</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Over the course of a scene, you shunt a touched object\u2019s weight into the higher plane, reducing the effect of gravity on it, halving its weight for each of your dots in forces. Reach is applied to duration.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Optional Arcana: Space 3</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">You can also shunt some of its mass, causing it to shrink, reducing it in size equal to your dots in Space.</span></span><br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Fourth Attainment; Warp the Fourth Axis</span></span></b><br /> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Prerequisite: Forces 4, Science/Academics 4</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">As an instant action you boost the kinetic energy an object through space as per control velocity. As an object exerts more forces on the world, the more malleable the space around it becomes.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Optional Arcana: Space 4</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">You can describe a specific path for the subject as per alter direction.</span></span><br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Fifth Attainment; Master the Fourth Axis</span></span></b><br /> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Prerequisite: Forces 5, spend a day outside of mundane space.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">You leverage the forces before you to bridge the gulf between dimensions. You remove the forces around you as per Eradicate Energy, but the effect is not destructive as it is used to bridge the fourth axis. Electricity will short out, winds still, silence descends depending on the energy targeted.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Optional Arcana: Space 5</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">For one scene and 1 mana, excuse yourself from 3D space which flattens before you, rendering your presence local but imperceptible, hidden in an undefinable direction. As such you take up no physical space in the world any attempts to detect you are hindered by your dots in Forces. You leave normal mundane traces on the world, like scent, fingerprints and sounds.</span></span><br /> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">1 mana: You warp the space around you and count as in touch range for the area from which you sapped energy.</span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":28563,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28563-hydrophiliak","user":"Hydrophiliak","date":". 08-27-2024, 08:23 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28563-hydrophiliak","name":"Hydrophiliak","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar28563_1.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-08-29T07:04:56-07:00","id":1541191,"title":"","content":"The initiation seems to involve Death and Spirit Twilight, before building something akin to the infinite staircase from memories in the Oneiros. What would make the memories qualify for it ? How many would be enough ? The Realms visited don't seem to have any further connection to the Attainments. I am not sure I understand how it ties with the 4th axis, could you please clarify ?<br /> <br /> Regarding oblations, they should probably be something that can be practiced in a scene. Traveling for a long time and trying to see all the sides of an issue seem like they take longer than that. <br /> <br /> In the format of the Attainments, I think adding how Reach is being used would be helpful. The third main and fifth optional Attainment are missing the activation ritual.<br /> <br /> Since the 4th axis is spatial, Space focuses on the effects of a shift in perspective, of moving things along the 4th dimension. What is the theme for the Forces ones please ?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2648"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-08-30T16:36:58-07:00","id":1541251,"title":"","content":"It is a bit all over the place. The concept was taken from Flatland, about a bunch of 2D life being observed by a 3D being, so I wanted to imagine what it might be like for a 3D being trying to see the world from the 4th spatial dimension, like inward eye, outward eye mimics. Most of the attainments are trying to mimic that perspective.<br /> I wanted to use Forces as a tool to explore space, but the initiation was more something that just happened in the campaign. Having this as a more long standing tradition would be interesting, but I'm at a bit of a loss as to what a group of people with this kind of legacy might look like.<br /> <br /> I'll take your advice about adding reaches to give the attainments more structure, they might fall into place a bit more mechanically if it's considered, thanks!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28563-hydrophiliak","name":"Hydrophiliak","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar28563_1.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}